Looking at this problem, I need to compute:

$$S = \frac{1}{\cos\frac{6\pi}{13}} - 4\cos\frac{4\pi}{13} - 4\cos\frac{5\pi}{13}$$

**Answer leak check:** The problem contains only the statement to compute, no solutions or hints. Proceeding.

